            "review_title": "Review at The Beach Bistro",
            "review_text": "Stay34172160729\n8 contributions\n0\nFantastic seafood buffet and vibrant evening entertainment\nAug 2026 • Family\nWe had an amazing evening at The Beach Bistro Phu Quoc. The seafood buffet was fresh and plentiful, with delicious grilled prawns and flower crabs, while the BBQ meats and freshly baked pizzas were equally tasty.\n\nBeyond the food, the entertainment made the night truly memorable. The live music set a great beachside vibe, the fire dance performance was impressive, and the lucky draw added a fun, exciting touch to the whole experience. Attentive service, great atmosphere, and definitely worth every penny. Highly recommended when in Phu Quoc!\nRead more\nWritten August 25, 2026",
